{"article":"第二十二条第四项","binding_status":"binding","clause_id":"SRC-CSRC-SUITABILITY-2022:CLAUSE-22.4","effective_from":"2022-08-12","effective_to":null,"excerpt":"向普通投资者主动推介不符合其投资目标的产品或者服务。","excerpt_sha256":"94e738e756b788e001a6df88ffd9c6d52a19456d6d97a0b0ebc543c354df8458","issuer":"中国证券监督管理委员会","jurisdiction":"CN","schema_version":"0.1.0","source_id":"SRC-CSRC-SUITABILITY-2022","title":"证券期货投资者适当性管理办法（2022年修正）","url":"https://www.csrc.gov.cn/csrc/c101950/c1048083/1048083/files/%E9%99%84%E4%BB%B61%EF%BC%9A%E3%80%8A%E8%AF%81%E5%88%B8%E6%9C%9F%E8%B4%A7%E6%8A%95%E8%B5%84%E8%80%85%E9%80%82%E5%BD%93%E6%80%A7%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%8A%9E%E6%B3%95%E3%80%8B.pdf"}
